       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPS10G.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SEQUENCE-NUM PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  RESULT-GROUP.
           05  TEXT-OUT PIC XX.
           05  NUM-OUT PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING RESULT-GROUP.
           MOVE 'AB' TO TEXT-OUT.
           MOVE SEQUENCE-NUM TO NUM-OUT.
           ADD 1 TO SEQUENCE-NUM.
           MOVE 99 TO RETURN-CODE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ZPS10G.
